  "editorial": "raise DomainError(...) from exc attaches the original exception as the cause. Logs and handlers can still see the OS error. A translation that returns only the domain word forces the next person to guess why it failed. The dict is that pair.",
  "reference_solution": "def solve(domain, cause):\n    return {\"error\": domain, \"cause\": cause}\n"
